{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#135","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#135","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#135\",\"parent_revision\":\"7714e4fc9705780ea844b7f213e61b61594798434e8412b1898b1674f39c6061\",\"root_revision\":\"7714e4fc9705780ea844b7f213e61b61594798434e8412b1898b1674f39c6061\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Why This Is Time Sensitive\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`.agents/skills/` is vendored from `github.com/jamie-bitflight/claude_skills`. Fixes made here are reverted by the next sync unless they are ported to the canonical copy.\\n\\nSeven fixes landed in this repo across #119 and #134, all found by Codex review of the vendored code.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Receiving Pr Reviews Scripts Pr Review Threads Py\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Deleted `_MIN_POLL_BUDGET_SECONDS = 5.0`** \u2014 an unsourced constant that could both skip the final poll *and* exit 1 on an ordinary run. Violated \\\"No invented constraints\\\".\\n- **Deleted `_GH_TIMEOUT_SECONDS = 30`** \u2014 also unsourced, and it capped an entire sequential `--paginate` run rather than a single request. Replaced by a `--gh-timeout-seconds` option.\\n- **Strict Pydantic ingress models** \u2014 producer-shape mismatches from `gh` now fail at the boundary instead of being coerced.\\n- **Unbounded baseline fetch** and `min` constraints on numeric options.\\n- **Comment-identity activity key** \u2014 `_thread_activity_key` previously keyed on `databaseId` and `comments_total`, so an *edit* to an existing comment moved neither and `watch` kept reporting `timed_out: true` while revised feedback sat unread. Three change kinds must register (reply, edit, reply past the 100-comment page) and no single component catches all three.\\n- **Split exception handlers.**\\n</div>\\n\\n## Receiving Pr Reviews Skill Md\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nTwo corrected gotchas.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Rebase Skill Md\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`git rebase <target> <branch>` positional form plus worktree-ownership guidance. The skill previously rebased the checked-out branch rather than the `<branch>` its own plan named \u2014 **that bug bit this session directly** while running many worktrees across many branches.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Note On Lint Scope\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`.agents/skills/` is excluded from ruff and ty in this repo (vendored code, maintained upstream). That exclusion covers style, not correctness \u2014 Codex still reviews these files and found real defects in them. Worth deciding whether vendored skills should carry review surface here at all.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- #119, #134 \u2014 where these landed\\n- #127 \u2014 prek's pinned node toolchain, which prevents verifying JS hooks locally\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"7b600d18d0fe2d44f25f2b8da9b4892145712bb0d996df2c8b798c5367336bde\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDORXxKvc8AAAABXP-m0w\"}"}